From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rijads <spaha92@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 09:41:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Show the build tools and park windows in radial menus on the
 PS5

Options shows the build tools (rides, paths, scenery, land, water, clear scenery) in a ring in the
middle of the screen, Triangle the park windows (rides, park, guests, staff, finances, research,
messages, map) when there is nothing to rotate. The stick or the d-pad points at an entry, whose
name shows under the ring; letting go of the button runs it. Tapped, the ring stays until Cross
picks an entry, or Circle or the same button closes it. This replaces the quick menu, which sat at
the pointer and could open behind the top toolbar.

On the controller: a press on the d-pad inside a list, but not on an item (on a heading, or beside
a short list), goes to the nearest item that way, or the nearest one. Turning, sloping or banking
track from a special piece such as a station platform starts from plain track, as the keyboard
shortcuts do nothing there.
